- id: cond-off-balance
  name: Off-Balance
  type: Condition
  tags: [Severity_1, Physical, Tactical, Debuff]
  passive: "Your footing is compromised. Impact of all attacks against you is increased by +2."
  action:
    - "Regain Balance: Success removes this condition."
  notes: "Action-to-clear forces a tactical choice: press the attack while vulnerable, or lose tempo to reset."

- id: cond-prone
  name: Knocked Prone
  type: Condition
  tags: [Severity_2, Physical, Tactical, Debuff]
  passive: "You are on the ground. The Kinetic Chain is broken."
  effects:
    - "You cannot play Attack Cards."
    - "Narrative Attacks suffer -5 Strength."
    - "Defense Actions cost +1 Resource Card from deck."
  action:
    - "Stand Up (General Action): Strength 15 (Red/Yellow). Cost: Add 2 Fatigue to deck."
  notes: "Added a 'Fatigue Cost' to standing up to ensure this maneuver drains 'Life' (Deck) even if cured."
